Stick around to the end of this video to see
the top 5, coolest, best Things You Missed

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:05.370
in IT (2017).

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:13.580
Before we get into the Top 5 Things You Missed
In IT, let me tell you about the worst one.

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:16.510
In this deleted scene, if you zoom into the
movie theater marquee you can loosely make

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:20.580
out the title of the 1988 film, Mac and Me,
but what's interesting is what you'll actually

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.920
find in an infamous scene from that movie.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:23.640
Roll it.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.640
"Stoooopp!"

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.100
So guys, we did it.

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.700
We reached a quarter of a million subscribers.

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:40.380
Ahhh that was a terrible meme.

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:43.260
But genuinely, genuinely, thank you for supporting
